OL,3,GNEWSALessons need to be learned from
OL,4,Awildfires, minister admits
OL,5,
OL,6,FLessons need to be learned about the
OL,7,Fway the nation deals with wildfires if
OL,8,Fmore are likely in the future due to
OL,9,Fclimate change, a government minister
OL,10,Fhas admitted.
OL,12,FDafydd Trystan Davies praised the
OL,13,F"remarkable response" of firefighters
OL,14,Fand soldiers during a visit to
OL,15,FTreherbert, Rhondda Cynon Taf, as
OL,16,Fseveral grass fires continue to burn in
OL,17,Fsouth Wales.
OL,19,FReform Wales criticised the Welsh
OL,20,Fgovernment's crisis management and the
OL,21,Ftime taken to bring in the Army and
OL,22,Faerial support last week.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
